WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:05.387
A young woman walked over to Dev. "I'm Pam.

2
00:00:05.388 --> 00:00:09.033
This big dog is Duke."

3
00:00:09.034 --> 00:00:13.994
Dev smiled. "I'm Dev, and this is Nero."

4
00:00:13.995 --> 00:00:18.109
Nero wagged his tail.

5
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:22.606
Soon other people and dogs arrived.

6
00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:25.740
The class started.

7
00:00:25.741 --> 00:00:31.201
"A dog and its owner form a bond," Pam said.

8
00:00:31.202 --> 00:00:36.767
"A good bond comes from good communication."

9
00:00:36.768 --> 00:00:41.456
Pam looked at Duke. "Sit."

10
00:00:41.457 --> 00:00:43.642
Duke sat.

11
00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:47.916
"Stay." Duke stayed.

12
00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:54.747
Nero rolled his eyes. "Anyone can do that."

13
00:00:54.748 --> 00:00:57.529
"Speak," Pam said.

14
00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.419
Duke barked. "Woof!"

15
00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:04.956
Nero chuckled. "[i@That's@i] not—"

16
00:01:04.957 --> 00:01:10.119
"Shh!" Dev held a finger to his mouth.

17
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:15.991
Nero looked down. "Dev thinks Duke is incredible.

18
00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:19.599
Well, I can be incredible too!"

19
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:28.035
Pam started explaining more commands for dogs.

20
00:01:28.036 --> 00:01:35.631
Nero ran to a tunnel.

21
00:01:35.632 --> 00:01:41.405
"Nero! That's not for this class!" Pam called.

22
00:01:41.406 --> 00:01:44.121
Nero didn't listen.

23
00:01:44.122 --> 00:01:47.832
Instead he dived into the tunnel.

24
00:01:47.833 --> 00:01:52.433
"Wait till Dev sees this!" he thought.

25
00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:57.149
The tunnel got bunched up and twisted.

26
00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:02.310
"Grr!" Nero dragged himself out of it.

27
00:02:02.311 --> 00:02:06.898
Next he ran to a hoop and tried to jump through.

28
00:02:06.899 --> 00:02:10.773
But the hoop fell over. [i@Crash!@i]

29
00:02:10.774 --> 00:02:15.001
The sound startled Nero, and he bolted.

30
00:02:15.002 --> 00:02:19.193
"Nero, come!" Dev yelled.

31
00:02:19.194 --> 00:02:22.419
But Nero ran up a seesaw.

32
00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:27.146
The seesaw tilted.

33
00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:31.751
"Nero, come!" Dev yelled.

34
00:02:31.752 --> 00:02:36.365
Nero took a step, but the seesaw wobbled.

35
00:02:36.366 --> 00:02:41.394
Nero froze. "How do I get down?"

36
00:02:41.395 --> 00:02:45.926
Duke ran over. "Woof!"

37
00:02:45.927 --> 00:02:49.558
"He's asking if I need help," Nero thought.

38
00:02:49.559 --> 00:02:54.374
Nero barked back. "No thanks! I'm good!"

39
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:58.958
But the big dog pushed on the seesaw anyway.

40
00:02:58.959 --> 00:03:04.016
"Oof!" Nero slid down and tumbled.

41
00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:08.157
Everyone—even Dev—laughed.

42
00:03:08.158 --> 00:03:11.429
Nero felt awful.

43
00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:14.969
Dev and Pam came over.

44
00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:18.929
"Are you okay, Nero?" Dev asked.

45
00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:22.556
"No!" Nero thought.

46
00:03:22.557 --> 00:03:29.161
Pam shook her head. "You two have poor communication."

47
00:03:29.162 --> 00:03:35.291
Nero's heart sank. "That means our bond isn't good."

48
00:03:35.292 --> 00:03:39.977
Nero barked—and took off running!

